### XSLT Transformation - Predefined (data.xml + style.xsl)
GET http://localhost:8080/transform/test

### XSLT Transformation - Dynamic XML (Using predefined style.xsl)
POST http://localhost:8080/transform
Content-Type: application/xml

<root>
    <item>
        <name>테스터</name>
        <age>20</age>
        <score>100</score>
    </item>
</root>

### Test with Video Data structure
